!   			

'output control'                                                            			

			

'output of spatial data'                                                    			

5                            ;number of output times (spatial data)	

0.1 1 2 3

4.0

								

			

'coordinate output'			

			

'output of transient data'                                                  			

6                             ;number of output locations (transient data)  			

1                              ;timesteps between output (transient data)			

0.0   0.0 20.0d0             ;xout, yout, zout in meters"			

0.0   0.0   19.7

0.0   0.0   19.5

0.0   0.0   19.3

0.0   0.0   17.0

0.0   0.0   14.0



'done'                                                                      			

